<p nodeId="234a558ded4249e7ad5928f73e8f97dc"><span font-size="14">添加</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[685]" nodeId="23cb548d7e7d45eab4313db1fe60183f">
<ol nodeId="106886ccd21b4c989f5b99e8adf9fe8b">
<li nodeId="5a648667dd1b46489b914d7f82bfb66e"><span font-size="14">逐条选择</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">规则</span></span><span font-size="14">，一次添加多个（场景VS规则= n VS n）</span></li>
<li nodeId="d4b8c5619cc04ff3880999d29db7b7df"><span font-size="14">逐条选择</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">规则组，</span></span><span font-size="14">一次添加多个（场景VS规则组= 1 VS n）</span></li>
<li nodeId="c6e2a20949164771b00d67687686d122"><span font-size="14">按照</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">规则标签</span></span><span font-size="14">筛选规则，将标有同一个规则标签的规则添加到场景中（场景VS规则= 1 VS n）</span></li>
<li nodeId="778f617e852d4465962b6766f01febdc"><span font-size="14">按照</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">场景标签</span></span><span font-size="14">筛选场景，将某个规则添加到标有同一个场景标签的场景中（场景VS规则= n VS 1）</span></li>
<li nodeId="bd59e717b0cd458d8c1e1b925f3bb3f8"><span font-size="14">按照规则已形成的场景配置，将</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">某个决策新增</span></span><span font-size="14">到场景中</span></li>
</ol>
</td>
</tr>
