<li nodeId="136aa077c3ba46e5bdcd474807bcaca2"><span font-size="14">按照</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">规则</span></span><span font-size="14">筛选场景配置（单值），修改决策、决策理由、优先级和状态</span></li>
<li nodeId="5c37cc7ea09642b38ace568e52fbfad8"><span font-size="14">按照</span><span color="rgb(48, 84, 235)"><span font-size="14">规则组</span></span><span font-size="14">筛选场景配置（单值），修改决策、决策理由、优先级和状态</span></li>
